[{"answer":"Ah, there you are. Hi, Jared.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Hi, Colleen. You still got time?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I've got almost an hour.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/3.mp3"},{"answer":"My next class isn't until three-thirty.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/4.mp3"},{"answer":"That should be enough time, shouldn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/5.mp3"},{"answer":"We haven't got that much to decide now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/6.mp3"},{"answer":"It depends how it goes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/7.mp3"},{"answer":"We've got our topic, but we haven't divided up the workload yet.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/8.mp3"},{"answer":"And we haven't even discussed how to approach it, really.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/9.mp3"},{"answer":"I thought one of us was going to take the coelenterates and the other was going to do the sponges.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Seems pretty simple.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, well, that's fine for the basic research,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/12.mp3"},{"answer":"but don't forget that we've got to make the presentation together.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/13.mp3"},{"answer":"We just can't be 'stings' and 'squirts', like Laurel and Hardy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/14.mp3"},{"answer":"We're going to have to field questions from the rest of the seminar, and from Doctor Mankiewicz, too!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, and they can be brutal! So?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/16.mp3"},{"answer":"So, we both have to have a pretty good grasp of the whole thing, the overall picture.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Don't forget that the key word is 'comparative',","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/18.mp3"},{"answer":"'A Comparison of the Adaptive Evolution of the Coelenterata and Porifera'.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/19.mp3"},{"answer":"It's not just how jellyfish have evolved and how sponges've evolved,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/20.mp3"},{"answer":"but a, an analysis of their comparative success.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/21.mp3"},{"answer":"So I guess we need to get together and really look at that together, don't we?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, we sure do.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/23.mp3"},{"answer":"And it's going to take some thinking,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/24.mp3"},{"answer":"because I don't think we're going to find all that much material on this idea.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/25.mp3"},{"answer":"There're whole books on invertebrate evolution...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, but each phylum is kind of looked at independently,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/27.mp3"},{"answer":"you know, at least they're in the same texts I've been reading through.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Which are?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Hyman's 'Invertebrates'.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/30.mp3"},{"answer":"McEdward's 'Ecology of Marine Invertebrates'.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/31.mp3"},{"answer":"McEdward's really good, he's got a lot of fascinating examples,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/32.mp3"},{"answer":"but he doesn't really look at one phylum versus another in term of relative, uh, relative success.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/33.mp3"},{"answer":"He just marvels at their individual, uh, creativity.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, that's good stuff...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/35.mp3"},{"answer":"But we're gonna have to take it a step further than that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, look, we're still beginning with each of us researching a phylum, aren't we?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, yes, that's still a good starting point for sure, but...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/38.mp3"},{"answer":"I know, so let's get going on that then,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/39.mp3"},{"answer":"learn something about these critters, and then try to put it together after we've got an idea what we're talking about.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/40.mp3"},{"answer":"We've got six weeks to do this thing,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/41.mp3"},{"answer":"so why don't we, well, bulldoze our way through this first part in, say, two weeks?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/42.mp3"},{"answer":"And then plan to get together a lot after that to intercalate what we've found.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/43.mp3"},{"answer":"And get some original ideas.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/45.mp3"},{"answer":"We can, like, mini-present to each other and see what angles we can come up with.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Put four weeks into that, and we might have something.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/47.mp3"},{"answer":"So, what do you like?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/48.mp3"},{"answer":"Huh? What do I what?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Which ones you want, sponges or jellyfish?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh. Yeah. Huh!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Y'know, they're actually both very intriguing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/52.mp3"},{"answer":"Amazing beasts.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Frankly, though, the coelenterates look pretty daunting,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/54.mp3"},{"answer":"there's such a, you know, range of forms and behaviour.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/55.mp3"},{"answer":"The sponges seem much more manageable.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/56.mp3"},{"answer":"But what about you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/57.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm easy, really.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Ha! That's funny,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/59.mp3"},{"answer":"to me, the Porifera seem kind of boring.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/60.mp3"},{"answer":"They're so, so... sessile.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/61.mp3"},{"answer":"They just sit there and filter.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/62.mp3"},{"answer":"They remind me of my grandfather.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/63.mp3"},{"answer":"I like that. Stick it in the presentation!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Maybe.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Anyway, I'll be happy to take the jellyfish,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/66.mp3"},{"answer":"they interest me much more.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/67.mp3"},{"answer":"OK. Say, this is working out well so far.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, but the hard part comes later.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/69.mp3"},{"answer":"So, shall we look at our schedules and see if we can arrange a regular time to meet?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Uh, sure. Once a week?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/71.mp3"},{"answer":"For now, yeah, that's enough, I guess.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, how about this time?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/73.mp3"},{"answer":"Um... yeah, that'll be good for me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/74.mp3"},{"answer":"So... Tuesdays at 1 p.m.?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Fine. Uh... here?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/76.mp3"},{"answer":"This'll be OK, I think.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/77.mp3"},{"answer":"Not too noisy after lunch hour.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/78.mp3"},{"answer":"All right, then I'll see you next week, on the seventh.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/79.mp3"},{"answer":"No! I'll see you in the seminar on Thursday, won't I?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/80.mp3"},{"answer":"Huh, yep. Gotta go.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/81.mp3"},{"answer":"Right. Thanks. Later.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-12-2023-02-15-23-39-14/82.mp3"}]
